@startuml
title Login and Role Check Sequence

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Accounts Service" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Session Manager" as Session
participant "Audit Log" as Audit
participant "Protected Page" as Page

User -> UI: Submit email/SRN and password
UI -> Auth: Send login credentials
Auth -> DB: Retrieve user by email or SRN
DB --> Auth: Return user record

Auth -> Auth: Verify password and account status

alt Valid credentials and Verified account
    Auth -> Session: Create authenticated session
    Session --> Auth: Return session
    Auth -> Audit: Log successful login
    Auth --> UI: Login successful
    UI --> User: Redirect to role dashboard
else Invalid credentials or account not Verified
    Auth -> Audit: Log failed login
    Auth --> UI: Return login error
    UI --> User: Display error message
end

User -> Page: Request protected page
Page -> Session: Validate session and role
Session --> Page: Return authentication and role

alt User has required role
    Page --> User: Display authorised page
else Invalid session or insufficient permissions
    Page -> Audit: Log denied access
    Page --> User: Deny access
end

@enduml
